0.50 & $-18.0{\pm}0.5$ & $+822.6{\pm}18.3$ & $-37.1{\pm}0.4$ & $-50.4{\pm}1.0$ & $+21.0{\pm}0.1$ \\
0.75 & $-27.6{\pm}0.2$ & $+1791{\pm}18$ & $-32.3{\pm}0.5$ & $-41.0{\pm}1.0$ & $+182.6{\pm}0.7$ \\
